Package: CDEnrich
Title: Enrichment Analysis for Cell Death Pathways
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Yushan",
        family = "Chen",
        email = "chen_yushan0625@163.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    Provides a curated collection of gene sets for major cell death
    modalities, together with tools for over-representation analysis,
    gene set enrichment analysis, single-sample gene set enrichment
    analysis, differential pathway analysis, and visualization.
